Super Mario Bros. overworld and The Legend of Zelda main theme:
music by Koji Kondo / Nintendo. Tetris Type A: traditional Korobeiniki,
Game Boy arrangement by Hirokazu Tanaka. Composition rights remain with
their respective holders; the software license does not relicense the music.
The added backing parts are CHGame adaptations, not original sound dumps.

